{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkejkrDk3WKRSnB7n82P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I scrolled to \"משיכה ומעבר\". I have what I came for, so I'm stopping here.\n\n**What I'd tell my friend:** You can take the money out after 6 years and you pay no tax on it. In their example you put in 300 ₪ a month and the employer adds 900 ₪. If you take it all after 5 years you get about 66,500 ₪, and tax eats about 14,000 ₪ of that. I'm fairly sure about the 6 years because it's in the first lines and on the chart. I'm less sure about the amounts. The example isn't my salary, and the page never says what I'd get if I wait the full 6 years.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **What I looked at:** The heading and the line under it, \"אחרי תקופה שקבע החוק אפשר למשוך בלי מס\". Then \"אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה\". Then the calculator: 2.5% from me, 7.5% from the employer, 7 for return and 0.54 for fees. Then the bar chart, red \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\" on one side and \"מ־6 שנים: פטור ממס\" on the other. Then the bars underneath: +54,000, +8,487, −13,974 and \"נשאר בידיים\" 66,5…\n- **What I skipped:** The paragraph full of numbers under the chart (50,719, 29,768, 15,794 and more). The assumptions about inflation and \"מחירים של היום\". The S&P track paragraph. Every \"חוקים וכללים\" tag. \"שווה לדעת\" (I only read the first lines). \"מי מציע\", \"הצגת חברות\" and \"משיכה ומעבר\".\n- **Where I hesitated:**\n  - The calculator opens set to 5 years, which is the year you pay tax. So the first big number I saw was a 14,000 ₪ minus in red. That scared me, and I still don't know what I'd have at 6.\n  - The total \"66,5…\" was cut off at the left edge, under the scroll-up button.\n  - I scrolled right past the salary field, so I don't know which salary the 300/900 example uses.\n- **Words I didn't get:** \"מסלול מדד\", \"תשואה אחרי דמי ניהול\", \"החזר ממס הכנסה\", \"קופת גמל להשקעה\".\n- **What I'd change:**\n  - Open the calculator at 6 years, so the first number you see is the tax-free one.\n  - Put the shekel total on the bars themselves.\n  - Ask for my salary right at the top.\n  - Don't let the scroll button cover the numbers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3870,"cache_read_input_tokens":11858,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3870},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0a01bca6-5f1a-4476-9877-777f61377e3e","uuid":"fa1c8b87-bfd2-4cf3-a379-045020f82afe","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:30:27.904Z","request_id":"req_011CgkejkdZoBXC5gSNjtGp7"}
